{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t選舉委員會界別分組一般選舉早上9時開始投票。截至下午4時，投票率97.39%，5560名選民投票。<br/>\n<br/>\n多個界別的投票率達到100%，包括商界（第一）、商界（第三）、香港僱主聯合會、工業界（第一）、會計界、工程界、法律界、科技創新界、基層社團、建築、測量、都市規劃及園境界。<br/>\n<br/>\n投票率最低是保險界，有81.82%，72人已投票，界別選民人數有88人。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T08:43:51.253571+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T08:17:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T09:57:27.103752+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T08:37:24.491344+00:00","content_hash":"27916659c2e962817838d5a00fbaf003393d7f3cbc71e263ff43968dbbe5b448","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}